  "question": {
    "text": "Let $F(x)=e^{x}, G(x)=e^{-x}$ and $H(x)=G(F(x)),$ where $x$ is a real variable. Then, $\\frac{d H}{d x}$ at $x=0$ is",
    "image": null
  },
